--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Vendored engine sources are pinned in vendor/VERSIONS with their upstream commit
and license id, and each vendored tree keeps its own upstream LICENSE file in
place. Every component listed there is permissively licensed: this package can
never carry copyleft code, because its whole promise is unrestricted commercial
use by the apps that embed it.

ai_package_gate.rb checks that every vendor/<name>/ directory has both a pin in
vendor/VERSIONS and an entry here before it can ship.

ggml
    Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors
    MIT License. https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml
    Pinned at 06ca97616793248fadb410ea8d69c7511b2005e4. Full license text:
    vendor/ggml/LICENSE.

    One shared copy. llama.cpp and whisper.cpp each bundle their own ggml
    upstream; both are built against this single tree instead, so the package
    carries one set of tensor symbols rather than two.

